    <coordinates><x>1580</x><y>1420</y><w>300</w><h>160</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>No aggregates: SkuVelocityView and
BatchRiskView are materialised by the
Kafka Streams topology (state stores);
AgentTraceRecord, MarkdownProposal and
EndOfDayBriefing are written by the two
agents and persisted for audit.
bg=#FFFBE6</panel_attributes>
