  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates><x>1000</x><y>1450</y><w>540</w><h>70</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>MarkdownProposal is what the agent's proposeMarkdown tool hands the
orchestrator (spec-06); it carries no price. The margin floor is never
evaluated here (R5).
bg=#FFFBE6</panel_attributes>
